This house on Rue de la Tour has retained its original architecture. The magnificent stone staircase leads upstairs to the former kitchen/living room, now transformed into an exhibition room. The Association de Sauvegarde du Site Archéologique de Sauveterre de Rouergue (ASSAS) displays memorabilia from the bastide.

